## 30. Analytics caveats

Do not count server/link-preview crawler hits as genuine recommendation views.

A page request is not necessarily a human view.

Prefer client-side meaningful view instrumentation after page hydration/visibility where appropriate.

Avoid double-firing events due to React renders.

Server-authoritative events should be used for persisted actions where practical:
- recommendation created
- response saved
- pass-on recommendation created
- account upgraded

Development/local activity must not pollute production metrics.

